  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Detection, deterrence and elimination of IUU fishing in Seychelles waters and EA-SA-IO region through targeted MCS actions and capacity building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: To improve governance and management of coastal and offshore fisheries resources while increasing revenue generation for national growth.Specific objectives: 1)To enhance regional cooperation in surveillance and enforcement through MCS data sharing and information exchange2)To enhance capacity for MCS activities including personnel, institutional and equipment with final objective to conduct joint surveillance with neighboring States3)Detect, deter and eliminate IUU fishing in Seychelles Waters and EA-SA-IO Region.4)To enhance compliance levels of licensed vessels</narrative>
  </description>
